'''Silver Celestial''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing second on the tokens collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2024]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Celestial]], but it's color scheme has been altered to silver colors.

== Trivia ==
* It has [[Red Celestial|red]], [[Bronze Celestial|bronze]] and [[Gold Celestial|gold]] variants.
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].

* The sole owner of this weapon is [https://www.roblox.com/users/1540274019/profile Mrt_Tiago].


